'''Jacob''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Farmhouse}} and {{Zone|The Garden}}. He hosts [[Jacob's Farming Contest|Farming Contests]].

== Event ==
{{Main|Jacob's Farming Contest}}
'''Jacob's Farming Contest''' is an [[event]] that takes place every {{Green|3}} [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock Days]], and lasts for {{Green|1}} [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock Day]] during which three random crops from the [[Collections#Farming%20Collections|Farming Collection]] are selected for players to collect.

